### Login Prime User
# @name login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "prime@demo.com",
  "password": "ShopSmart123!"
}

### Hero Query
POST http://localhost:5000/api/assistant/shop
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "I need a high-performance laptop for software development and some gaming, under $1000."
}

### No category/budget => clarifying question
POST http://localhost:5000/api/assistant/shop
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "I need a laptop for software development and some gaming."
}

### History lowers budget
POST http://localhost:5000/api/assistant/shop
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Actually, can you find something cheaper?",
  "history": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "I need a high-performance laptop for software development and some gaming, under $1000." },
    { "role": "assistant", "content": "Here are some laptops under $1000." }
  ]
}

### Empty message (400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/assistant/shop
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": ""
}

### No token (401)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/assistant/shop
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "I need a laptop under $1000."
}
